        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e4d2b8da-3b92-527a-9d18-3cfdb05f57f7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Henry\n- Products: WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2007, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2009, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2010, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2011, WWE '12, WWE '13, WWE 2K14, WWE 2K15, WWE 2K16, WWE 2K17, WWE 2K18\n- Companies: Yuke's, Visual Concepts, 2K Sports\n- Topics: video game appearances, game development, game release\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Henry made his video game debut in WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2007.\n- Mark Henry later appeared in WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2009, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2010, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2011, WWE '12, WWE '13, WWE 2K14, WWE 2K15, WWE 2K16, and WWE 2K17.\n- WWE 2K16 included two playable versions of Mark Henry.\n- Mark Henry was set to appear as a legend in WWE 2K18.\n- WWE 2K18 was an upcoming professional wrestling video game developed by Yuke's and Visual Concepts in collaboration.\n- 2K Sports was the publisher of WWE 2K18.\n- WWE 2K18 was scheduled for worldwide release on October 17, 2017 for PlayStation 4, Xbox One, and Microsoft Windows.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "4f303986-1032-5437-acb3-c1c9739ccb76",
        "text": "Page: Mark Henry. Sentence: Mark Henry made his video game debut in WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2007.\nPage: Mark Henry. Sentence: Ever since, he had appeared in WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2008, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2009, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2010, WWE SmackDown vs. Raw 2011, WWE '12, WWE '13, WWE 2K14, WWE 2K15, WWE 2K16 (with 2 playable versions), WWE 2K17, and will appear as a \"legend\" in WWE 2K18\nPage: WWE 2K18. Sentence: WWE 2K18 is an upcoming professional wrestling video game being developed in a collaboration between Yuke's and Visual Concepts, and to be published by 2K Sports.\nPage: WWE 2K18. Sentence: It is scheduled to be released worldwide on October 17, 2017 for PlayStation 4, Xbox One and Microsoft Windows.",
